OL,3,GNEWSAThe woman who dressed Doctor Who
OL,4,Aand Kate Bush
OL,5,
OL,6,FStanding behind some of British
OL,7,Ftelevision's most memorable costumes,
OL,8,FJoyce Hawkins helped shape the look of
OL,9,Fprogrammes watched by millions, yet her
OL,10,Fwork was rarely seen beyond the screen
OL,11,Fitself.
OL,13,FNow, a new exhibition at Birmingham
OL,14,FCity University is bringing that work
OL,15,Finto the spotlight, showcasing original
OL,16,Fcostume designs created during Hawkins'
OL,17,F30-year career with the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
