OL,3,GNEWSAThe woman who dressed Doctor Who
OL,4,Aand Kate Bush
OL,5,
OL,6,FCostume Matters features sketches,
OL,7,Fartwork and production documents from
OL,8,Fdramas including Doctor Who, Anna of
OL,9,Fthe Five Towns and Vanity Fair, which
OL,10,Fearned Hawkins a Bafta nomination.
OL,12,FAmong the highlights are designs
OL,13,Fcreated for singer Kate Bush for a 1979
OL,14,FBBC television special.
